{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22530","headline":"题故曹王宅 · 白居易","name":"题故曹王宅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"甲第何年置，朱门此地开。\n山当宾阁出，溪绕妓堂回。\n覆井桐新长，阴窗竹旧栽。\n池荒红菡萏，砌老绿莓苔。\n捐馆梁王去，思人楚客来。\n西园飞盖处，依旧月裴回。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22530.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22530","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}